1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,664
Before the event: planning docs, agent skills and my open-source MME harness.

2
00:00:05,714 --> 00:00:09,950
Everything you'll see in Maqet was built this week.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,830
Four million people in Argentina build their own homes, in stages, as they save.

4
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:24,650
An architect or a designer from day one is rarely within reach, and a mistake gets paid for with their savings.

5
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:25,490
Picture Rosa.

6
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:30,950
She wants to add a bedroom, and all she has is this drawing.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,950
Maqet turns that drawing into a measured project: how it looks, what to buy at each stage, and a drawing for the professional.

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,859
A technician visits with a phone.

9
00:00:42,909 --> 00:00:51,102
First Meta model: Muse Spark reads the drawing and the written measurements, for less than a cent.

10
00:00:51,152 --> 00:00:53,041
What's estimated says so.

11
00:00:53,091 --> 00:00:55,950
The AI proposes, a person decides.

12
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:56,891
No drawing?

13
00:00:56,941 --> 00:01:03,950
The technician measures the room in augmented reality: corners, doors and windows, with real measurements.

14
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,772
Add a three-by-four bedroom for my daughter, on the north side.

15
00:01:08,822 --> 00:01:10,087
Back to Rosa.

16
00:01:10,137 --> 00:01:13,594
She asks in Spanish, with her own voice.

17
00:01:13,644 --> 00:01:18,416
Muse Voice Transcribe hears her, and Muse Wonder edits the home.

18
00:01:18,466 --> 00:01:26,745
But it doesn't draw: it only uses validated tools, and every change goes through construction rules written in code.

19
00:01:26,795 --> 00:01:28,936
And add a second floor.

20
00:01:28,986 --> 00:01:29,813
Undo that.

21
00:01:29,863 --> 00:01:33,758
And when something needs a professional, it says so.

22
00:01:33,808 --> 00:01:35,950
Maqet never certifies a structure.

23
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:44,950
Muse Image shows how the room could look, starting from the measured geometry, not from the model's imagination.

24
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:50,950
And in augmented reality, she sees her extension on her own table.

25
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:55,035
And now, what no image app gives you.

26
00:01:55,085 --> 00:02:02,184
A material list by stage, to buy as she saves: bricks, cement, sand, steel.

27
00:02:02,234 --> 00:02:09,844
And a DXF with real measurements, for the professional who will review and sign it.

28
00:02:09,894 --> 00:02:14,950
No model writes these numbers: they come from deterministic code.

29
00:02:15,000 --> 00:02:21,512
Four Meta models, each in its place: Spark reads, Voice listens, Wonder edits, Image shows.

30
00:02:21,562 --> 00:02:32,450
And none of them is in charge: one measured scene is the source of truth, and 3D, AR, materials and DXF all derive from it.

31
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:35,950
More than 1,500 automated tests, all open source.

32
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:39,181
Everything is preliminary, and says so.

33
00:02:39,231 --> 00:02:41,873
Maqet doesn't replace the architect.

34
00:02:41,923 --> 00:02:49,950
It gives people who could never afford one a first measured project, from day one.
